      "effect": "Add 2 \"Reindsurm\" monsters from your Deck to your hand, then send 1 card from your hand to the GY, then if your opponent has a Dragon monster in their field or GY, you can add 1 Insect monster from your GY to your hand. If you Ritual Summon an Insect monster(s) while this card is in your GY: You can banish this card; place 1 \"Reindsurm\" Field Spell from your Deck face-up on your field. You can only use each effect of \"Reindsurm Practice\" once per turn.",
      "official": false
    },
